+
+[research.md](./research.md) records nine decisions, each verified by execution before being
+written down:
+
+| ID | Decision | Serves |
+|----|----------|--------|
+| R-001 | `argparse` with **`parse_intermixed_args`** — `parse_args` is verified to reject `a.log --count b.log` | FR-001, FR-029 |
